---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 联系我们
description: 联系 Foreign Immigration Services 提交咨询，或直接通过电子邮箱与我们联系。
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <p class="tag">联系我们</p>
    <h1>联系与咨询</h1>
    <p class="service-lede">告诉我们可以如何为您提供帮助。</p>

    <p>无论您是计划办理移民申请、需要协助处理目前的身份问题、需要为员工提供支持，还是遇到具有时效性的移民事务，您都可以通过以下咨询表单联系 Foreign Immigration Services。</p>

    <p><strong>电子邮箱：</strong> <a href="mailto:info@foreignimmigration.ph">info@foreignimmigration.ph</a></p>

    <form id="enquiry-form" class="enquiry-form">
      <div class="form-field hp-field" aria-hidden="true">
        <label for="website">请勿填写此字段</label>
        <input type="text" id="website" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
      </div>

      <div class="form-field">
        <label for="fullName">姓名 <span class="required-mark" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
        <input type="text" id="fullName" name="fullName" data-field-label="姓名" autocomplete="name" required>
      </div>

      <div class="form-field">
        <label for="email">电子邮箱 <span class="required-mark" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
        <input type="email" id="email" name="email" data-field-label="电子邮箱" autocomplete="email" required>
      </div>

      <div class="form-field">
        <label for="phone">电话号码／其他联系方式 <span class="hint">（选填）</span></label>
        <input type="text" id="phone" name="phone" data-field-label="电话号码／其他联系方式" autocomplete="tel">
      </div>

      <div class="form-field">
        <label for="nationality">国籍 <span class="required-mark" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
        <input type="text" id="nationality" name="nationality" data-field-label="国籍" required>
      </div>

      <div class="form-field">
        <label for="location">目前所在国家／地区 <span class="hint">（选填）</span></label>
        <input type="text" id="location" name="location" data-field-label="目前所在国家／地区">
      </div>

      <div class="form-field">
        <label for="language">首选沟通语言 <span class="hint">（选填）</span></label>
        <select id="language" name="language" data-field-label="首选沟通语言">
          <option value="en">英语</option>
          <option value="zh-CN" selected>简体中文</option>
          <option value="zh-Hant">繁体中文</option>
          <option value="ko">韩语</option>
          <option value="ja">日语</option>
          <option value="vi">越南语</option>
          <option value="other">其他</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div class="form-field form-field--full">
        <label for="service">所需服务 <span class="required-mark" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
        <select id="service" name="service" data-field-label="所需服务" required>
          <option value="" disabled selected>请选择服务</option>
          <option value="visa-applications">签证与移民申请</option>
          <option value="work-visas">工作与雇佣签证</option>
          <option value="extensions-compliance">延期与合规</option>
          <option value="residency-status">居留与长期身份</option>
          <option value="family-spousal">家庭与配偶签证</option>
          <option value="corporate-mobility">企业与全球调动</option>
          <option value="status-review">移民身份审查与合规协助</option>
          <option value="motions-blacklist">移民复议、黑名单与不良记录协助</option>
          <option value="legal-support">外籍人士法律协助</option>
          <option value="airport-vip">机场贵宾接送服务</option>
          <option value="lost-passport">护照及旅行证件遗失协助</option>
          <option value="acr-icard">ACR I‑Card 协助</option>
          <option value="exit-clearance">离境许可与出境要求</option>
          <option value="document-verification">签证与移民文件核实</option>
          <option value="complex-tailored">复杂及定制移民协助</option>
          <option value="property-transfer">房产过户与文件协助</option>
          <option value="other">不确定／其他移民事务</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div class="form-field form-field--full">
        <div class="context-note">
          <p>请勿通过本咨询表单提交护照扫描件或其他敏感文件。如需提交相关支持文件，我们将另行提供安全提交的指引。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="form-field form-field--full">
        <label for="description">简要说明／我们可以如何为您提供帮助？ <span class="required-mark" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
        <textarea id="description" name="description" data-field-label="简要说明" required></textarea>
      </div>

      <div class="enquiry-form-actions">
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">发送咨询</button>
        <p id="enquiry-form-status" class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </div>
    </form>

    <div class="service-cta">
      <h2>接下来会发生什么？</h2>
      <p>我们的团队将审阅您提供的信息，并通过您留下的联系方式与您联系。如需补充信息或支持文件以评估您的咨询，我们会另行通知您。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script defer src="/assets/js/portal-config.js"></script>
<script defer src="/assets/js/enquiry-form.js"></script>
